    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "CONCEPT",
      "narration_text": "The architecture is split into four core modules. We have helper dot py for data ingestion, models dot py for adapting datasets to Laya's encoder-head format and handling choice, score, and binary decisions.",
